WEBVTT

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:09.020
I am pleased to see you all here.

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:13.530
Yes, Master! I arrived fifteen minutes ago.

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.450
Why the sudden summons?

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:19.690
Is it for a group lesson? If it's at
Leo's level, it'll be nice and easy.

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:20.280
Excuse me?!

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:25.490
Quiet, please. Our lesson today
will not take place at a desk.

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:37.430
Today we will have a field
trip into the capital, Wiener,

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:41.430
to learn about the lives
of the common citizens.

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:16.570
The Princes Go To Town

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:15.000
Today, we will have a field
trip into the capital, Wiener,

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.650
to learn about the lives
of the common citizens.

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:20.590
Field trip?

00:02:20.590 --> 00:02:23.040
We're going into town?! Woohoo!

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:25.030
What are we doing? Shopping?

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:30.140
Our trip is not for amusement.
It is a lesson to groom you for the throne.

00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:31.150
Phooey.

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:34.330
Is it truly all right for we
princes to go about town?

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:38.630
I've read about this subject,
but I've never left my carriage.

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:41.840
I've never walked through town, either.

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:47.850
I've been to Anne's café, and to Rosa's
seamstress shop, and Corinna's cabaret—

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:51.020
You've gotten around too much,
you shameful boy.

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:52.810
Ow! What was that for?

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:57.930
Now, now. Going to town
is a good experience.

00:02:57.930 --> 00:03:00.100
It is also relatively safe these days.

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:02.790
Right? He gets it.

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:05.630
Shall we, Your Highnesses?

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:06.720
Yeah!

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:08.930
I will learn all that I can, Master!

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:10.490
I'm not going.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:15.740
I've never walked about town,
either. So what?

00:03:15.740 --> 00:03:19.170
Why would a royal ever need to
know about commoners' lives?

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:22.050
I see what you mean to say.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:25.550
Two hundred years ago in the history
of the Glanzreich royals...

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:28.920
Princess Marie married into
the royal family of Fonsein.

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:32.250
Ignorant of the poverty of the masses,
she lived a life of luxury.

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:38.800
Angered by her indulgences, the people
revolted and sent her to the guillotine.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:40.440
Th-The guillotine?

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:42.890
There is an illustration of the execution.

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:49.290
But I will not force Your Highness to go.

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:51.500
I-I only need to go, right?

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:55.540
I'll learn about the commoners' lives,
s-so spare me from the guillotine!

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:58.660
I have learned how to
handle Prince Leonhard.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:03.140
Please assemble at the courtyard
carriage house at ten o'clock.

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:08.180
We will be incognito. I ask that you wear
clothing that won't give away your identities.

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:09.510
Understood.

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:10.980
'Kay!

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:16.230
How strange.

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:19.250
It is ten o'clock, yet no one is here.

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:20.890
Here I am, Professor!

00:04:20.890 --> 00:04:23.900
Ta-da! I'm a snazzy gentleman.

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:27.360
I see you are already accustomed to disguises.
It fits you like a glove.

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:32.320
Oh, but it took an awful lot
of time to dress them all up.

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:38.920
My, my. Your Highnesses all look dashing.
You will blend in splendidly.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:44.420
Is this enough?
I thought it better to hide our faces.

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:47.330
I told you, that only makes
you more conspicuous.

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:49.170
If I hadn't stopped you...

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:54.230
You'd look like some dangerous masqueraders!

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:56.760
I see your work was cut out for you,
Prince Licht.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:05:02.570
Now let us be on our way. Do be careful
not to draw attention to yourselves.

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:03.840
Okay!

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.020
Brothers!

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:07.490
Adele! Grandmother!

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:11.930
My dears, please don't get hurt or ill.

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:14.800
Come... come back home safe!

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:16.560
We'll be fine, Grandmother.

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:19.290
Yes, the professor will be with us.

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:21.160
It is difficult to leave...

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:21.920
Ha!

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:26.400
Have a safe trip, Your Highnesses!

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:27.650
See ya!

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:28.230
Be careful!

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:33.890
A short jaunt into town is a
major event for royals, hmm?

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:35.880
Pardon me.

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:38.270
Please stop in this alley.

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:39.480
Yes, sir.

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:51.530
Town!

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:54.330
It's so bustling.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.580
Now... hmm?

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:58.160
Whisper, whisper...

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:00.000
Shall we?

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:05.600
Reading a map and actually walking
through town are quite different.

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:07.760
I fear I would get lost
if I were here alone.

00:06:08.140 --> 00:06:12.150
I should first memorize the map,
then compare it to the scenery...

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:13.630
You needn't go that far.

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:16.600
Heh! Amateur.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:20.980
All right! Today I'll show
you all the shops I know.

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:22.110
After me!

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:32.940
What's wrong?

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:38.320
Now that I think about it, I always followed
my lady friends around. I'm totally lost.

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:42.140
Couldn't you have realized before
you made us walk all this way?!

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:43.000
Bleh!

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:45.250
In any case, it seems to
be quite crowded here.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.210
Excuse me?!

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:47.770
There are people everywhere...

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:54.010
This is the ring road, commonly called
"The Ring." It is the town's main road.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:56.680
Here we see the national opera house,

00:06:56.680 --> 00:07:02.350
and the town hall. Major public institutions
are all built around The Ring.

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:04.850
Hoo boy. That's why it's so crowded?

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:09.870
Yes. Wiener is a cosmopolitan city
with a population of 1,300,000.

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:12.090
Do stay close, so we are not separated.

00:07:12.090 --> 00:07:15.040
Especially you, Prince Leonhard.
Are you listening?

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:19.930
I-If they find out I'm a prince,
I'm bound for the guillotine... the guillotine...

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:22.030
He's developed a phobia of commoners.

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:25.220
You'll be fine so long as they
don't find out you are a prince.

00:07:25.220 --> 00:07:26.850
Come along, look where you're walking.

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:29.540
Are you sure? Is this really safe?!

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:32.470
Whisper, whisper.

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:34.360
Are you sure it will be fine?

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:36.670
Are you absolutely sure? Positively?

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:38.460
Shall I leave you behind?

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:39.810
Cut it out!

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:44.130
What are your thoughts on
your first time in town?

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:46.370
Lots of stores...

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:50.280
Truly. Since we have
reached the shopping district,

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:53.660
would Your Highnesses like
to split up to shop?

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:54.970
Huh? Shopping?

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:57.780
I will be at the bookstore.

00:07:57.780 --> 00:08:00.750
I've never shopped before.

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:03.030
Seriously, Leo?

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:05.410
Shall we give it a go, then?

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:07.630
Will this general store do?

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.420
Wh... Fine.

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:12.090
Okay, Leo. Follow the plan.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:13.090
Got it.

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:15.430
What is this whispering about?

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:17.580
Well, let us go inside.

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:21.440
Welcome.

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:25.280
Choose something you want
and hand it to the clerk.

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:28.730
I don't know where to start...

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:33.190
This! It's so cute! I must have it!

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:35.100
That is cute?

00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:38.130
That will be fifty-five kreuzer.

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:40.810
What?! I don't have fifty-five coins!

00:08:40.810 --> 00:08:47.140
No, no. This is a twenty-kreuzer coin.
Three coins would be sixty kreuzer.

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:51.270
If you don't understand,
pay with one florin coin.

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:53.400
One florin is equivalent
to one hundred kreuzer.

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:55.390
Your change will be forty-five kreuzer.

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:59.050
Here! Take as much as you wish!

00:08:59.050 --> 00:08:59.750
Huh?

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:02.900
If he was not a royal,
he would not survive.

00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:06.610
Erm... I'll take what the
doll is worth, then.

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:10.930
I'm taking sixty kreuzer,
so your change is five kreuzer.

00:09:12.390 --> 00:09:15.610
Look! I shopped! How do you like that?

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:17.270
How wonderful...

00:09:17.270 --> 00:09:19.360
That the clerk was so kind.

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:21.600
Thank you!

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:26.270
Well, we have a little errand.
See you later, Professor!

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:27.400
Very well.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.690
We'll meet later, Kai.

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:35.760
They are certainly up to something.

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:39.260
How goes it? Are you enjoying the bookstore?

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:42.070
Master! I didn't hear you come in.

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:43.890
The bookstore is a truly magnificent place.

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:47.640
I always asked a servant to
fetch the books I needed.

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:54.040
But being here in person, I'm intrigued by
many books from fields I've never studied...

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:56.660
I'm sure. But I must ask...

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:59.020
Do you mean to buy all of these?

00:09:59.020 --> 00:09:59.900
Yes.

00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:03.910
I realize that I cannot carry them all,
and I've exceeded my budget, but still...

00:10:04.260 --> 00:10:07.700
Then you will have to buy only the
books you want most of all.

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:08.790
Indeed...

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:12.060
I absolutely need these two.
I need this, too.

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:13.980
And I've been searching
for this one for ages.

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:16.300
Ah, I want this book, too!

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:18.540
I need all of them!

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:23.050
No! If it is impossible, then I should
concede defeat with good grace.

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:25.360
I'll take just this, please!

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:26.150
Huh?

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:29.270
Um... We can hold books for you, sir.

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:29.870
Huh?

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:34.910
I decided to buy the rest at a later date.

00:10:34.910 --> 00:10:37.250
Splendid. Still, despite the hangup...

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:39.270
Money? Money?

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:41.870
I lack sufficient funds. I must choose!

00:10:42.310 --> 00:10:46.420
You seem as though you could get by even
if you were not a royal, Prince Bruno.

00:10:47.220 --> 00:10:50.060
Master is acknowledging me...

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:51.870
Oh, Master!

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:55.500
Oh, no, it is not that
much of a compliment.

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:57.980
By the by, where is Prince Kai?

00:10:58.430 --> 00:11:00.000
He said he was going to the plaza.

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:05.270
Is that you, Prince Kai?

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:12.950
I bought pigeon feed.

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:14.100
Kai!

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:16.960
I wanted to cuddle with the pigeons.

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:18.840
Want to feed them, Professor?

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:20.190
Thank you.

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:25.620
Do not feed wild birds

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:23.580
They gather quite quickly.

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:27.030
Master, are you all right?!

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:29.710
Master!

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:33.100
Thank God you made it in time.

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:35.190
I thought I would never see him again.

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:37.050
You need not worry.

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:39.390
Hey, you guys! Come over here!

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:41.990
Look! It's a sausage stand!

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:44.140
I'm peckish. Let's try it!

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:47.620
Now hold on, where are the seats?

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:49.170
I guess you eat standing up.

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:53.520
S-Standing up?! Do you not
use a knife and fork?

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:54.640
Unfathomable.

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:58.260
Allow me to give you a
demonstration, as a commoner.

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:01.440
Excuse me, sir. Five käsekrainer, please.

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:02.770
Here ya go.

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:07.290
Hold it by the bun,
open wide, and take a bite.

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:08.240
That is all.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:10.850
Well, Your Highnesses? Simple, yes?

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:12.530
Mm. That hits the spot.

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:15.530
It seems so... vulgar.

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:16.670
How rude.

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:19.050
What are you saying, Leonhard?

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:22.480
Master suffered extreme hardship
to give us that demonstration.

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:24.910
Bruno, don't force yourself...

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:27.900
Oh! It's so good!

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:30.590
And so relaxed, too. I like it!

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:31.910
Huh?

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:37.760
You had more firsts than I anticipated.

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:42.000
Bringing you to town made for
a worthwhile experience.

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:46.490
The sun is setting. When you are finished
eating, let us return to the palace.

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:45.640
Grandma, can I have a käsekrainer?

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:46.500
All right, dear.

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:47.530
Yay!

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:53.820
Th-Thief!

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:57.360
Grandma! Grandma!

00:12:57.360 --> 00:12:58.450
Ow, ow, ow...

00:12:58.450 --> 00:12:59.880
Are you all right?!

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:02.580
Oh, no. He's already so far...

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:05.250
Preying on a frail old woman... The coward!

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:07.550
Let us call the policemen.

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:10.760
Yes, of course. Licht, you see to her.

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:11.260
Got it!

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:13.330
Grandma, are you okay?

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:16.360
It was just a tumble, dear.
I'm sorry for scaring you.

00:13:16.630 --> 00:13:19.890
Thank goodness he pushed me and not you.

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:21.180
Grandma...

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:24.150
I'm just happy you're safe.

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:26.200
Dry your eyes, now.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:27.780
Grandmother...

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:30.170
Leonhard?

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:32.650
I won't forgive that thief.

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:36.110
Wait here! I'll get your bag back!

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:38.260
He needs a lesson!

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:41.970
Quiet. You'll draw attention to yourself.

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:45.060
I can catch up to him in no time at all.

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:48.260
I've won the top prize in the junior track
and field 5th division for 3 years in a row.

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:50.300
Don't underestimate me!

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:58.020
Kai?

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:00.740
The thief.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:06.820
While you all talked, I ran and got the bag.

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:08.460
What?!

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:12.410
You're the bag snatcher?
You're coming with us.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.820
I won't forgive that thief!

00:14:14.820 --> 00:14:17.730
I'll get your bag back!

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:19.610
Stop that now.

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:23.600
I-I didn't know Kai had
already gone after him.

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:26.730
It is a good thing it did not
turn into a big commotion.

00:14:27.150 --> 00:14:29.190
It could have been dangerous if
they were found out to be princes.

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:31.960
In any case, you reacted so swiftly.

00:14:31.960 --> 00:14:34.990
Professor, you knew Kai chased after him?

00:14:34.990 --> 00:14:35.760
Yes.

00:14:36.110 --> 00:14:40.090
I was so surprised that I ended up
leaving it entirely in his hands.

00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:46.900
E-Excuse me. I want to thank you,
but this is all I have to offer.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:48.780
Will this candy do?

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:51.990
A new kind of candy... Happy...

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:57.750
Oh, goodness! They have this everywhere.
But I'm glad you like it.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:59.750
Would you boys like some, too?

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:02.820
N-No... I didn't do anything.

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:05.160
Don't be silly.

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:06.190
Huh?

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:11.540
You stood up bravely for a perfect stranger.

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:14.680
The sentiment alone made me very happy.

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:16.390
Thank you so much, dear.

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:21.420
Thank you...

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:26.100
I'm glad I came to town today,
and got to meet them.

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:34.450
Your Highnesses! Professor!
Your ride home is here.

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:37.670
Thank you for guarding us today.

00:15:37.670 --> 00:15:40.270
Huh? Were you with us all day?

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:41.070
Yes, Your Highness.

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:42.500
Of course they were.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.450
If anything happened to you princes,

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:47.760
the future of this town and the
very kingdom would be at risk.

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:55.320
Look.

00:15:56.980 --> 00:15:58.440
It's gorgeous.

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:01.290
There's the bookstore I visited.

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:03.960
Then that must be the general store...

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:05.560
It was pretty fun.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:09.250
Is that your only impression
after visiting town?

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:10.070
Huh?

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:14.310
What caught Your Highnesses'
eyes the most in town?

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:17.490
The magnificent books.

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:19.080
All the stores!

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.190
The cute things...

00:16:20.190 --> 00:16:24.010
The käsekrainer, of course!
That was super delicious.

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:26.370
You have not learned the lesson.

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:29.350
What is it, then?

00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:34.870
What you saw the most were the people
living in town, and each of their smiles.

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:38.010
But there was a bad guy, too.

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:45.250
True, but the policemen's swift handling of
the situation left a bigger impression on me.

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:49.840
The power to deal with problems quickly
and maintain public safety...

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:54.190
A prosperous, energetic town
full of smiling people...

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:57.030
These are sights you would
not have seen years ago.

00:16:57.320 --> 00:17:00.400
1,300,000 people live here.

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:08.800
1,300,000 different viewpoints and
personalities. 1,300,000 livelihoods.

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:13.450
It is only natural that there would be many
societal problems with such a large population.

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:23.430
But your father, King Viktor, toiled to
bring smiles back to this town and this kingdom.

00:17:24.220 --> 00:17:27.500
Please do not forget that the legacy of

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:32.440
your father's hard work lies within
each of those twinkling lights.

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:38.490
And... please aim to be a king who will make
this kingdom's history shine even brighter.

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:40.580
Master! When we get home,

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:42.280
I will immediately revisit my writings

00:17:42.280 --> 00:17:44.330
and consider what is best
for the kingdom's future.

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:47.190
If I became king, I'd have young
ladies wear swimsuits, and...

00:17:47.190 --> 00:17:49.640
What are you doing to our kingdom?!

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:53.640
I want a kingdom where everyone feels safe.

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:55.120
Prince Kai?

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:57.140
Peace is the most important...

00:17:57.140 --> 00:17:59.060
That's Kai for you.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:02.930
I don't understand the
complicated parts, but...

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:07.020
I want to beat up all the bad guys
and make this a kingdom full of smiles!

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:09.900
Wh-What?

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:18.750
Wh-What's so funny? If something I
said was strange, then say so.

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:21.920
No, that's great. It's simple, and so are you.

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:23.910
You're a good boy, Leonhard.

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:27.160
By the by, Prince Licht.

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:30.050
What is that package at your side?

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:34.170
Huh? Uh, it's nothing special! Right, Bruni?

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:34.930
R-Right.

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:37.690
I think I'll just look at my new doll now...

00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:40.810
Predictable brothers.

00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:43.130
They are clearly hiding something.

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:47.690
Ah, well. I suppose it means they
have not yet completely accepted me.

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:53.230
Heine! Where are you going?

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:57.430
Prince Leonhard. My dinner seems
to be late, so I am going to...

00:18:57.430 --> 00:19:00.290
Th-Then won't you join me for a stroll?

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:00.940
I beg your pardon?

00:19:01.270 --> 00:19:05.120
You should be grateful for
an invitation from a prince!

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:10.700
Oh? Your Highness, this is not so much
a stroll as it is you carrying me...

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:26.310
This is decidedly suspicious.

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:31.360
Wait here.

00:19:32.390 --> 00:19:34.340
Hey, is it ready yet?

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:36.050
Huh?! We still need a little time!

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:38.320
What?! I already brought him!

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:40.680
But Bruni and Kai aren't done yet!

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:44.700
Whatever you are scheming,
you needn't bother hiding it any longer.

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:47.950
I will not be surprised by
anything you throw at me.

00:20:03.350 --> 00:20:06.630
Welcome to Weissburg Palace!

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:14.220
My brothers made the food!

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:19.730
Some of the dishes may not be pleasing to the
eye, but they should be pleasing to the tongue.

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:25.020
How do you like that? And you said we
couldn't surprise you. Serves you right!

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:29.370
We didn't have a welcome party yet...
so we decided to today...

00:20:30.130 --> 00:20:32.790
C'mon, don't stand around. Eat!

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:41.650
We think it turned out well.

00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:47.890
How is it, Professor?

00:20:48.670 --> 00:20:50.820
It tastes delightful.

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:52.260
Prince Kai.

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:53.940
Prince Bruno.

00:20:54.340 --> 00:20:55.810
Prince Leonhard.

00:20:56.260 --> 00:20:57.570
Prince Licht.

00:20:57.960 --> 00:21:00.700
I am honored that you would welcome me.

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:04.310
A small gift from us.

00:21:04.310 --> 00:21:07.200
The book that you bought? Thank you.

00:21:07.630 --> 00:21:09.930
"The Master and Apprentice's
Journey of the Heart"?

00:21:09.930 --> 00:21:11.410
Why would they give me this book?

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:14.420
This is from me.
You said it was cute, didn't you?

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:16.580
I certainly did not.

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:18.960
I'd love to see you in this outfit.

00:21:19.360 --> 00:21:21.910
Now this is a dangerous
masquerader's outfit.

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:23.630
From me.

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:37.990
Thank you, everyone.

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:49.040
I was so restless in this room before,
but the feeling has waned.

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:53.400
It must be because they gave
me a heartfelt welcome.

00:21:55.190 --> 00:21:57.320
What a happy night it was.

00:22:00.700 --> 00:22:05.240
Even though I don't belong here...

00:23:39.510 --> 00:23:43.230
Hey, Kai, you're super strong.
What's your secret?

00:23:43.230 --> 00:23:47.900
Eat well, sleep well, cuddles every day.

00:23:47.900 --> 00:23:49.710
What does that last one have to do with it?!

00:23:48.030 --> 00:23:53.730
Next Time:

00:23:48.030 --> 00:23:53.730
Assailed by the Greatest of Trials

00:23:49.710 --> 00:23:52.060
Next time,
"Assailed by the Greatest of Trials"!

00:23:52.060 --> 00:23:54.060
Cuddles are important.
